OL,3,GNEWSAMan proud to discover memorial for
OL,4,Agreat-uncle killed in WW1
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 85-year-old joined in Cadent's
OL,7,FArmistice Day ceremony earlier, and
OL,8,Fsaid he was "very pleased" to learn his
OL,9,Fgreat-uncle had been remembered.
